@startuml
title src / source — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
:Read current state without moving execution;
:Display current source range with two nearby lines, mark next statement or failed statement;
:Use existing palette, do not invoke Vector;
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
@enduml
